OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers are possible,
OL,6,Fthese mostly through the morning.
OL,7,FOtherwise, most places will have a dry
OL,8,Fday with sunny spells. A little breezy
OL,9,Fin coastal regions but feeling warm in
OL,10,Fthe sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening with
OL,13,Fclear periods. Bands of showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain will arrive in
OL,15,Fthe north and west later. Turning
OL,16,Fwindier and staying relatively mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
