OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA rather windy day with brisk
OL,6,Fsoutherly winds. Showery rain, heavy
OL,7,Fat times, erratically edging
OL,8,Fsouthwards, but some places may remain
OL,9,Fdry until the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,12,Fin places on Saturday, erratically
OL,13,Fclearing south. Drier with some
OL,14,Fsunshine on Sunday then damp at times
OL,15,Fon Monday. Breezy at times but staying
OL,16,Frather warm for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
